      "id": "matins",
      "title": "Matins",
      "sourceHeading": "Ad Matutinum",
      "pages": [
        49
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Gloria in excelsis Deo, et in terra pax hominibus bonae voluntatis.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine labia mea aperies.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0002",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et os meum annuntiabit laudem tuam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0003",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Deus in adjutorium meum intende.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Domine ad adjuvandum me festina. Gloria Patri etc.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymnus",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O mi Jesu! quis hic status! Deus a Puella natus, Princeps pro Regali aula Vili recubas in caula In Praesepre reclinatus, Summus compar infimo: Cui condignum Deo Chorum Gens sonabat Angelorum, Nunc pro musica coelesti Gaudes tibia agresti, Atque simplici Pastorum Delectaris lituo.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. O Regem Caeli, cui talia famulantur obsequia! stabulo ponitur, qui continet mundum: jacet in Praesepio, qui regnat in caelis.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Exultavit ut gigas ad currendam viam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. A summo caelo egressio ejus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Odulcis Jesule! O bonitas infinita! da obsecro, ut velut propter me hominem coelestis Patris reliquisti delicias: sic ego amore tui mundanis omnibus renunciem voluptatibus, nec alio tendam, nisi ad Te. Qui cum Patre et Spiritu Sancto vivis et regnas in saecula saeculorum. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0012",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
    },
