          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Belle Puer, Jesu chare, Quis non possit te amare; Quis, o Pusio formose, Cujus genas pingunt rosae, Quis te nolit adorare, O dilecte Parvule! Cujus oculi sagittae In amantem expediatae, Cujus residet in labris Cum coraliò cinnabris, Quis, o Decor infinite? Quis te amet congrue?",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            49,
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Oculi ejus sicut columbae super rivulos aquarum, dentes illius, sicut arcole aromatum, labia ejus lilia distillantia myrrham primam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Dilectus meus candidus et rubicundus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Electus ex millibus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Odulcis Jesule! Pulchritudo excedens omnem pulchritudinem: da, amore tui ita me capi, ut creatas elegantias facilem spernens, nec pulchrum aestimem, neque decorum, nisi te, speciosae prae Filiis hominum. Qui cum Patre etc.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            50
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "terce-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
    },
