          "id": "vespers-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O mi Jesu! qui sic amas, Absit, quin et meas flammas Tuis velim sociare, Sicque tibi adornare, Ut quod unice inclamas Lectulum calidulum; Sed o sacri vos Amores! Vestros meum per ardores Ocyus Cor inflammate Et frigenti praeparate Sacros inter calores Jesu meo Lectulum!",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            51
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "vespers-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Si invenieritis dilectum meum, nuntiate Ei, quia amore langueo.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            51
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "vespers-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Concalvit cor meum intra me.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            51
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "vespers-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et in meditatione mea exardescet ignis.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            51
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "vespers-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
